    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon</em></p><p>This glass jar, 3 inches across, holds 1d4 + 1 doses of a thick paste that smells faintly of aloe. The jar and its contents weigh 1/2 pound.</p><p>As a Utilize action, you can swallow one dose of the ointment or apply it to a creature within 5 feet of yourself. The creature that receives it regains 2d8 + 2 Hit Points and stops having the &amp;Reference[Poisoned apply=false] condition.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-oJubnbuJ8wMZT6wh\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Le pot compte 5 doses, le maximum : lancez [[/r 1d4 + 1]] quand il est trouvé et retirez les doses en trop. Retirez l’état Empoisonné à la main.</p></section>",
